  "label": "Stereotype: Manual Labor as Inferior",
  "description": "This is a societal stereotype that devalues manual labor and skilled trades compared to white-collar or academic professions. The meme uses the workshop scene to implicitly challenge this stereotype by portraying manual labor as a viable and respectable path to success.",
